markus@techfak.uni-bielefeld.de
Freely Distributable, No Public Domain !
Giftware, send me a postcard if you like this program.
Include standard disclaimer..  Run at your own risc !

Basically, Frac is a visualisation
of the forumala:
x=y-sign(x)*sqrt(abs(b*x-c))
y=a-x
 
================
Installation:
------------

1.  Copy the file frac.opa to the \app directory of the Psion.
    This is the only file you need. The source file is only 
    needed, if you want to modify it.
2.  In the system 'screen' install it as an application using the 
    Psion-i key.  This will add the Frac icon to the system screen.

